=== HANDLER_DIFFS ===
drivetrain_health_handler.go: 1 SQL rewrite (avg_power_w, started_at, ended_at). Variable rename powerMax->powerMaxW. JSON shape unchanged.

regen_handler.go: 2 SQL queries rewritten (per-drive 90d + monthly 12mo). distance_m/duration_s/avg_speed_mps/avg_power_w/start_soc_pct/end_soc_pct. Conversion at Go boundary: distance to miles via /1609.344, regen score uses W->kW and mps->mph factors (driveStatsKilo, driveStatsMpsPerMph). Monthly avg_regen_power_kw key preserved (W->kW divide). JSON tag renames: duration_min->duration_s, avg_speed_mph->avg_speed_mps, avg_power_kw->avg_power_w, min_power_kw->min_power_w, start_battery_pct->start_soc_pct, end_battery_pct->end_soc_pct.

route_efficiency_handler.go: 2 SQL queries rewritten (List route summary + Detail per-trip). start_place/end_place replace start_address/end_address. avg_distance_km computed via distance_m/1000. avg_duration_minutes computed via duration_s/60. Speed converted mps->mph in SQL. JSON tag renames: avg_duration_min->avg_duration_minutes, duration_min->duration_s, avg_speed_mph->avg_speed_mps, start_battery_pct->start_soc_pct, end_battery_pct->end_soc_pct.

speed_profile_handler.go: 3 SQL queries rewritten. Speed bucket boundaries translated to mps (15/30/45/60/75 mph -> 6.7056/13.4112/20.1168/26.8224/33.528 mps). Category buckets 30/60/90 mph -> 13.4112/26.8224/40.2336 mps. Distance filters use driveStatsMetersPerMile. avg_speed in km/h via distance_m / duration_s * 3.6. JSON tag renames: avg_power_kw->avg_power_w, avg_speed_mph->avg_speed_mps.

temp_impact_handler.go: 3 drives queries rewritten (efficiency buckets, monthly trend, scatter points). ambient_temp_c_avg replaces outside_temp_avg_c. distance_km via distance_m/1000, duration_min via duration_s/60. SoC math via start_soc_pct/end_soc_pct. vampire_drain_events SQL untouched (uses outside_temp_avg, not banned). JSON shape unchanged.

battery_degradation_handler.go: 4 charging_sessions queries + 1 drives query rewritten. peak_power_w replaces charger_power_kw_max (>50000W threshold). total_energy_added_wh replaces energy_added_kwh (W->kW divide at scan). start_soc_pct/end_soc_pct replace battery_pct columns in BOTH charging and drives. JSON shape unchanged.

driving_coach_handler.go: 1 SQL query rewritten. SI->display conversion AT SQL BOUNDARY (distance_m/1609.344, max_speed_mps/0.44704, avg_power_w/1000, start_soc_pct/end_soc_pct, ambient_temp_c_avg) so downstream coaching math (mph/kW/mi/C thresholds) is unchanged. JSON shape unchanged.

range_projection_handler.go: 6 drives queries + 1 charging_sessions COUNT(*) (kept). avgEffWhKm formula uses energy_used_wh / (distance_m/1000). Pre-existing SQL bug (AVG(...) ORDER BY LIMIT 30) preserved per covenant. avgSpeed averaged in mps and converted to km/h at Go boundary. Efficiency matrix: temp/speed buckets translated, formula preserves legacy "per mile" semantics via distance_m / driveStatsMetersPerMile. JSON shape unchanged.

